o'd. Use Paloo's signature drill attack, ground pound and other abilities to send enemies flying when they are stunned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/7a1c59fe61c67f915ec37c1c825d944a.poster.avif?t=1755557340\" width=360 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/7a1c59fe61c67f915ec37c1c825d944a.webm?t=1755557340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/7a1c59fe61c67f915ec37c1c825d944a.mp4?t=1755557340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies</strong> - From bats to bandits to multi-legged alien reptiles, each foe has their own way of attacking. Use your different moves and abilities to dodge, shoot, and knock the enemies into each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet Pokolo</strong> - Explore the zany planet of Pokolo, from the shanty town near Pok-Rok Canyon, to the chaotic streets of Rinka-Dink Capital.</p>",
